company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "The Cable Guy specializes in providing tier one installation and solutions aimed at meeting enterprise level needs of any sized business or home.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='the-cable-guy' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='The Cotton Mafia is a locally owned and operated screen printing company based in Las Vegas, Nevada. Founded in 2017 by a couple of participants in the local music and arts scene, the business began as an effort to provide affordable custom merchandise to struggling artists. The company is employee-owned.

The shop specializes in bulk and wholesale screen printing as well as vinyl sticker and label manufacturing. Its capabilities include custom screen printing on apparel such as t-shirts, sweatshirts, polos, hoodies, tank tops, and ladies'' styles, plus die-cut vinyl stickers, equipment labels, and printed merchandise like skateboards, tote bags, bottle coozies, and record player slip mats. The facility operates a warehouse for wholesale clients who ship garments for print-only contract work, and the company maintains a 7- to 10-business-day completion window for standard orders.

The Cotton Mafia serves bands, brands, businesses, conventions, and special events in the Las Vegas area. Wholesale accounts with apparel distributors are also a core customer segment, allowing those clients to send garments directly for printing.

The founders started the company to help local artists who could not afford high prices for locally printed merch, aiming to deliver the lowest cost and highest return on investment. The employee-owned structure is highlighted as a differentiator, with the team emphasizing hands-on customer service and quick turnaround to keep client deadlines on track.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing", "Vinyl sticker and label printing", "Die-cutting", "Wholesale screen printing", "Custom merchandise printing (apparel, skateboards, tote bags, coozies, slip mats)", "Print-only contract printing", "Mockup approval and production workflow"], "industries": ["Bands", "Brands", "Businesses", "Conventions", "Special Events", "Apparel Distributors"], "materials": ["Soft Cotton", "Vinyl"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "7-10 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["7- to 10-business-day standard turnaround", "Employee-owned and locally operated", "Wholesale print-only contract pricing for supplied garments", "Specializes in bulk screen printing and die-cut vinyl stickers/labels", "Focus on affordable custom merch for artists and small businesses"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 -> db", "Headquarters Las Vegas, NV -> db", "Employee-owned -> page /", "7-10 business day completion window -> page /", "Screen printing and sticker/label manufacturing -> page /", "Serves bands, brands, businesses, conventions, special events -> page /", "Started by couple guys in local music & arts scene -> page /", "Wholesale print-only contract pricing -> page /", "Address 1501 W. Oakey Blvd -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "The Cotton Mafia is a locally owned and operated Professional Screen Printing Company in Las Vegas", "founded_year": "2017", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Employee-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='the-cotton-mafia' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='The Flying Cow Shirt Company operates from Columbia, Missouri, tracing its roots to 1973 when it opened as Greek World to serve the University of Missouri’s sorority and fraternity community. The business rebranded in 1996, adopting a whimsical name chosen to reflect a broadening client base beyond Greek life.

The company produces custom printed apparel for orders ranging from single shirts to large corporate batches.

