UPDATE companies SET description='The Food Movement Natural Products Company was founded in 2011 in Arlington Heights, Illinois. The company began with a mission to deliver pure, plant-based nutrition to a global audience, emphasizing ingredients sourced from the earth and validated by science.

The company formulates and sells a range of dietary supplements under the Black Earth® brand, including fulvic and humic mineral concentrates, zeolite detox sprays, colloidal silver, magnesium complexes, and a line of organic superfoods such as Irish sea moss, maca, moringa, and plant-based vitamin C. The brand reports distribution through more than 1,000 health‑food stores nationwide and a direct‑to‑consumer channel serving over 10,000 customers.

The product categories target energy and vitality, daily balance, whole‑body support, and detoxification. The company also offers a subscription program for recurring deliveries.

