UPDATE companies SET description='The Furniture Ranch, a family-owned business founded in 1997, operates from Phoenix, Arizona. The company began with a focus on custom American-made furniture, handcrafted from solid wood.

The shop produces a range of custom furniture including bedroom sets, dining room tables, home office pieces, Murphy beds, upholstery, occasional furniture, kitchen and bathroom cabinetry, and doors. All items are built to order using solid wood, and the company offers delivery throughout Arizona and neighboring states. A 10-year guarantee backs every product.

Its showroom and workshop cater to clients seeking personalized furniture for homes, including custom cabinetry for kitchens and bathrooms.

