UPDATE companies SET description='The Urban Wood Company was founded in 2021 in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The business began as a supplier of premium kiln-dried live edge slabs, dimensional lumber, and reclaimed wood, and has since expanded into a full-service custom furniture and cabinetry shop.

The company operates what it describes as the largest vacuum kiln in the state alongside a fully equipped woodshop. Its sawmill capabilities include an on-site bandsaw mill with a 26-inch by 21-foot cutting capacity and an off-site mill capable of 58-inch by 18-foot cuts. Services span custom furniture design, milling, slab flattening, and wood drying, producing items such as live edge tables, river tables, conference tables, kitchen cabinetry, bathroom vanities, storage systems, and architectural millwork.

The company emphasizes its end-to-end control from slab to finish, highlighting the vacuum kiln for stable, dry lumber and the precision of its milling and woodshop operations. Customer feedback consistently points to knowledgeable staff and responsive service as distinguishing factors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Custom cabinetry", "Architectural millwork", "Live edge table fabrication", "River table fabrication", "Conference table fabrication", "Kitchen cabinetry", "Bathroom vanity fabrication", "Storage system fabrication", "Milling", "Slab flattening", "Vacuum kiln wood drying", "Bandsaw milling", "Dimensional hardwood processing", "Charcuterie board production"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Kiln-dried live edge slabs", "Dimensional hardwood", "Reclaimed wood", "Walnut"], "equipment": ["RF vacuum kiln (largest in state)", "On-site bandsaw mill (26\" x 21'')", "Off-site bandsaw mill (58\" x 18'')", "Fully equipped woodshop"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest vacuum kiln in Oklahoma for wood drying", "On-site bandsaw mill (26\" x 21'') and off-site mill (58\" x 18'')", "Fully equipped woodshop offering custom design, milling, slab flattening, and finishing", "Supplies kiln-dried live edge slabs, dimensional hardwood, and reclaimed wood", "Custom furniture and cabinetry built from raw slab to finished piece"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2021 -> db and page", "Headquarters in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma -> db and page", "Supplies kiln-dried live edge slabs, dimensional lumber, reclaimed wood -> page", "Operates largest vacuum kiln in the state -> page", "On-site bandsaw mill capacity 26\" x 21'', off-site mill 58\" x 18'' -> page", "Offers custom furniture design, milling, slab flattening, wood drying -> page", "Produces custom furniture, cabinetry, live edge tables, river tables, conference tables, kitchen cabinetry, bathroom vanities, stor