UPDATE companies SET description='The Wire Guy Electric was founded in 2017 by Steven Taylor in Mesa, Arizona. A family-owned operation from the start, Taylor brought over a decade of field experience to serve the Phoenix Valley with a team that now includes his partner Emma Woolington as office manager, service manager Cody Taylor, and a handful of technicians and apprentices. The company maintains two locations — one in Mesa and another in Scottsdale — and operates under Arizona ROC license #365306.

The firm provides a full range of electrical installation, repair, and maintenance services for both residential and commercial customers. Residential work spans new-construction wiring for custom homes, casitas, and additions; panel replacements and service upgrades coordinated with APS and SRP; EV charger installations (Tesla Wall Connector, ChargePoint, NEMA 14-50); recessed and custom lighting; kitchen and bath remodel circuits; and troubleshooting of faults from dead outlets to burning smells. Commercial services include tenant-improvement build-outs for general contractors and property managers, LED retrofits (high-bay, troffer, parking-lot), storefront and sign lighting, dedicated equipment circuits, emergency/exit lighting testing, and off-hours service for retail, office, restaurant, medical, and warehouse facilities.

Customers range from homeowners in communities such as Eastmark, Las Sendas, and Dobson Ranch to commercial property managers overseeing build-outs in Scottsdale’s DC Ranch or Phoenix’s Biltmore corridor. The company bids commercial TI work from plans, phases occupied-building lighting upgrades, and sizes circuits from equipment nameplates for kitchens, medical suites, and server rooms.

The Wire Guy Electric emphasizes transparent flat-rate pricing, a “no BS” quote policy, and a satisfaction guarantee that promises return visits if issues arise. The founders frame the business as a neighborhood resource — born and raised in Mesa — with a combined 30-plus years of trade experience across the team.', certifications=ARRAY['Arizona ROC #365306','Licensed','Bonded','Insured']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical repairs", "Custom lighting solutions", "Wiring solutions", "Panel upgrades", "EV charger installation", "Commercial electrical service", "Tenant improvements", "LED lighting retrofits", "Electrical troubleshooting", "New construction wiring", "Electrical safety inspections", "Exterior electrical", "Fixture replacements", "Dedicated circuits", "Emergency and exit lighting", "Ballast replacement and fluorescent lighting", "Kitchen and bathroom remodel electrical", "Recessed lighting installation", "Custom cabinet lighting", "Storefront and sign lighting", "Commercial outlet and switch work", "Commercial panel and service upgrades", "Load calculation and capacity assessment", "Off-hours commercial scheduling"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial (retail, office, restaurant, medical, warehouse)", "Construction (new construction, tenant improvements)", "Property management", "Electrical contracting"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family operated, born and raised in Mesa, AZ", "Transparent flat-rate pricing with no hidden fees", "Licensed, bonded, and insured (ROC #365306)", "Over 30 years of combined team experience", "Off-hours scheduling for commercial clients"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2017 by Steven Taylor in Mesa, AZ -> /about-us", "Family-owned, family-operated -> /about-us, /", "Two locations: Mesa and Scottsdale -> /, /about-us", "Arizona ROC license #365306 -> /, /about-us, /services", "Team of 6 named members (Steven, Cody, Cade, Wade, Emma, Lauren) -> /ab