UPDATE companies SET description='The company manufactures a range of small plastic containers, including snap-cap vials, hinged-lid containers, hinged boxes, and plastic jars with lids. Production uses polystyrene, polypropylene, and polyethylene (including high-density polyethylene), and the firm also distributes hundreds of related packaging items. All manufacturing takes place in the United States, though facility size and headcount are not disclosed.

Thornton Plastics serves the food industry and a variety of other sectors that use hinged-lid containers for packaging, shipping, storing, and sampling. Customers range from individual buyers to commercial accounts, with the company shipping orders as small as a 10-pack up to multiple pallets directly to the end user.

