UPDATE companies SET description='Topper Town has operated from Albuquerque, New Mexico since 1983 as a family-owned business. The company began serving local truck owners with accessories and installation services, building a reputation over four decades of hands-on experience in the region.

The shop supplies and professionally installs a range of truck accessories including camper shells, tonneau covers, bed liners, toolboxes, and racks. Each product is selected for durability, safety, and ease of use, and the installation work focuses on proper sealing and long-term performance. The facility on Osuna Road NE serves as both a showroom and installation bay.

The team advises on product choices based on work demands, travel habits, and local climate conditions such as intense sun, dust, and sudden weather changes.

