UPDATE companies SET description='Tops Packaging Solutions operates from Dowelltown, Tennessee, as a wholly-owned U.S. wholesale disposable packaging company. The business began with a focus on plastic food packaging and has accumulated over ten years of experience serving supermarkets and global retail brands.

