UPDATE companies SET description='Turner Welding and Fabrication LLC operates from Gillette, Wyoming. The company was founded in 2018 by Todd Turner, who brought over three decades of welding and manufacturing experience and a degree in Welding Technology from the University of Montana. Turner serves as owner and lead fabricator.

