UPDATE companies SET description='Twin City Fan Companies, Ltd. is headquartered in Mitchell, South Dakota, and was founded in 1989. The company operates as a group of brands—Twin City Fan, Aerovent, and Clarage—that together produce a full range of air moving equipment. While the firm emphasizes a family-oriented culture, the input does not specify its ownership structure or identify individual founders.

