UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2003 in Orlando, Florida, U.S. Apparel operates as a designer, manufacturer, and wholesaler of premium knitwear and swimwear. The company has spent over two decades building a catalog that spans men''s, women''s, and missy apparel, with a focus on fashion basics designed to become wardrobe staples.

The company manages the entire product lifecycle from design through manufacturing to wholesale distribution. Its offerings include knitwear essentials such as hoodies, crewnecks, tanks, and muscle tees, alongside a resort-inspired swim collection featuring cover-ups, board shorts, and long-sleeve surf styles. U.S. Apparel also supplies a full line of imprintable blank garments intended for screen printing, embroidery, and other customization methods, serving retail brands, promotional campaigns, and corporate identity programs.

Customers range from independent retailers and distributors to businesses and creators seeking customizable apparel. The company emphasizes flexible order quantities and fast turnaround times, aiming to provide competitive pricing and reliable service across the apparel, promotional products, and corporate identity markets.

