UPDATE companies SET description='United Foods International (USA), Inc. traces its roots to 1988 when Senba USA, Inc. was founded in San Francisco as a base for manufacturing and selling condiments and spices. The company later adopted its current name and moved its U.S. headquarters to Hayward, California, where it operates a West Coast factory. Additional U.S. facilities were opened in Belcamp, Maryland (2016) and Phoenix, Arizona (2021).

The company specializes in custom manufacturing of liquid and dry food products, including sauces (BBQ, hot, Asian, dressings), soup bases (broth, ramen, vegan), seasonings, batter mixes, baking mixes, and drink mixes. Its processing capabilities cover liquid filling, retort stabilization, powder blending (including Nauta and tote blenders), powder filling and packaging, cartoning, powder granulation, bottling assembly, soft drink production, deep drawing, baking via tunnel ovens, freezing, and tableting. Three U.S. plants are complemented by a global network of facilities in Japan, China, Thailand, Singapore, and Indonesia.

United Foods serves retail, foodservice, industrial, and wholesale channels, providing private-label products that appear in retailers and restaurants worldwide. Customers range from brands seeking custom sauces and soup bases to those needing dry seasonings, breading, and batter mixes for retail or foodservice distribution.

The company emphasizes its in-house research and development team, which handles recipe formulation, ingredient sourcing, and commercialization, and its adherence to GFSI-benchmarked food safety standards (SQF and BRCGS). It also offers natural, organic, kosher, gluten-free, and non-GMO manufacturing, and notes that its varied dry-blender sizes allow smaller production runs without the high premiums typical of larger co-packers.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','SQF','BRCGS','FSSC 22000','Organic JAS','JFS-B200000967-00']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom liquid processing", "Custom dry blending", "Research and development", "Recipe formulation", "Ingredient sourcing", "Liquid filling", "Retort processing", "Powder blending (Nauta)", "Powder filling and packaging", "Cartoning", "Powder granulation", "Bottling assembly", "Soft drink production", "Deep drawing", "Baking (tunnel oven)", "Freezing", "Cup dessert production", "Freeze flow", "Tableting", "Sachet liquid filling", "Frozen pasta production", "Full-service contract manufacturing"], "industries": ["Retail", "Foodservice", "Industrial", "Wholesale", "Private label"], "materials": ["Natural ingredients", "Organic ingredients", "Kosher ingredients", "Gluten-free ingredients", "Non-GMO ingredients"], "equipment": ["Liquid filling line", "Retort stabilizer", "Powder blender (Nauta)", "Soft drink line", "Deep drawing press", "Bottling assembly line", "Tote blender", "Automatic bag feeder and pillow packaging machine", "Cartoning machine", "Powder granulator", "Tunnel oven", "Freezer", "Cup dessert line", "Freeze flow system", "Tableting machine", "Sachet liquid filling line", "Frozen pasta line", "Powder soup filling and packaging line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house research and development team managing formulation to commercialization", "GFSI-benchmarked certifications (SQF, BRCGS) across all facilities", "Natural, organic, kosher, gluten-free, and non-GMO man