UPDATE companies SET description='United Premium Foods operates from Woodbridge, New Jersey, where it runs a USDA-, FDA- and SQF 2000 Level 2-certified facility. The company serves as a full-service co-manufacturer for human-grade and fresh premium pet food, while also producing a range of human food products including ready-to-eat meats.

Capabilities span R&D and recipe formulation, palatability testing, raw-ingredient sourcing, cooking, blending, packaging, labeling, slicing, curing, smoking and ready-to-eat packaging. The facility can handle small R&D runs through to millions of pounds per year for both raw and cooked pet food as well as cured and smoked meat products.

The company''s location in the Northeast Transportation Corridor—minutes from the New Jersey Turnpike, Garden State Parkway and Interstates 78 and 80—gives it ready access to major ports, airports and a dense supplier base, allowing national distribution from a central New Jersey hub.

